ce-label\">Energy <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Electrified Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Electrified_Icon_Big_b60abe.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:95.0000%; background-color:#d0bd56; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 5.0000%); display:inline-block;\">95%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.9500\" title=\"Earth\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Earth <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poisoned Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_Big_f04eb1.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:95.0000%; background-color:#d0bd56; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 5.0000%); display:inline-block;\">95%-?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Drown\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Drown <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Drowning Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Drowning_Icon_Big_f65e47.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Grounds%20of%20Fire\">Grounds of Fire</a>, a <a href=\"#/quest/ferumbras-ascension-quest\">Ferumbras' Ascension Quest</a> area.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tIt fights in close range and does not retarget often. Mazoran never retreats.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tThis boss is one of the easiest of its peers. The main danger when facing Mazoran is the floor, which will become Lava that deals 1500 <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\">Fire Damage</a> every minute or so. Thus, the safest strategy for the team is to position in one of the sides of the room and avoid moving. During the fight, <a href=\"#/wiki/Rage%20of%20Mazoran\">Rages of Mazoran</a> will also spawn when the floor becomes lava - they can be easily killed with Ice area attacks.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>On November 28, 2022, the Winter Update 2022 reduced its cooldown from 2 days to 1 day and 20 hours.</li>\n<li>As announced on March 12, 2024, the patch raised its experience from 50,000 to 250,000 as part of the 2024 Balancing Project.</li>\n<li>On April 09, 2024, the patch raised its experience once again, this time from 250,000 to 500,000 as part of the 2024 Balancing Project.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 35 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 50 samples — current sample size is below this threshold.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Gold Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Coin_a5b511.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>32-357</td>\n<td>180.2</td>\n<td class=\"\" data-sort-value=\"100.000000\" style=\"text-align:center;\">100%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Platinum Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Platinum_Coin_c8a106.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>12-40</td>\n<td>26.2</td>\n<td class=\"\" data-sort-value=\"100.000000\" style=\"text-align:center;\">100%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><spa